module type_units .
rem run: total 100 100

def type meters u64 .
def type feet u64 .

rem ko: 미터와 피트를 더했는데 아무도 막지 않는다 --- `type` 은 다른 이름일 뿐이다 /// en: meters and feet are added and nothing stops it --- `type` is only another name
fn total input m meters . input f feet . output meters .
  requires le m. 1000000 . .
  requires le f. 1000000 . .
do
  return add m. f. . .
end .
